{"2026.3.9:P11-Q04":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>废气吸收铜氨与溴乙酸反应</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 雅礼2026届高三上模拟预测 · 原题4 · P11-Q04</div><h1>废气吸收铜氨与溴乙酸反应</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：认识化学科学/离子反应/离子反应及离子方程式/离子方程式的书写</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：检查用量、配位和弱电解质拆写。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">认识化学科学/氧化还原反应/氧化还原反应基本概念</span><span class=\"tag\">物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span><span class=\"tag\">有机化学基础/烃的衍生物/卤代烃</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H∼1  N∼14  O∼16  Na∼23  S∼32  Cl∼35.5  Ti∼48</p><p>4. 下列离子方程式书写正确的是</p><p>A. 用<img src=\"chem-asset:ea7f7fc3eae810109f9ff922293bfc5a1bf5f2b660eaa08c22592fd85c2e085d:0;\" style=\"width:69.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液吸收废气中的<img src=\"chem-asset:8e8545a924bef272a7a6501251db651524b8ac36271a65e524b79ac375dd4622:1;\" style=\"width:28.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">：<img src=\"chem-asset:b460a2d7e3f0ea70af13a087a22216cbfce3956330d224f034b7c9946302625b:2;\" style=\"width:309.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. 向氨水中滴加几滴<img src=\"chem-asset:bf1aed82ef10df2ffe2db3a34ae024b72d56badb0b98b5039cef3271926dd9bd:3;\" style=\"width:49.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液：<img src=\"chem-asset:a282ffd93022e2d9ae45ebc75672299a413c6e67023cd6ee91610e3f288054ff:4;\" style=\"width:269.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 向<img src=\"chem-asset:0f0983ff0c1f496c39a6f22a5af50a53d1db835ba30cb8fe5dabce67223ac539:5;\" style=\"width:94.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">中加入足量的氢氧化钠溶液并加热：<img src=\"chem-asset:925ca357b4a59303ab68dd83197b7e8c670a858828c4f00a4f510884ca202a9b:6;\" style=\"width:310.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. <img src=\"chem-asset:5ec490b9a93fd999f26001f80983ab9d1b545c7ee40aa2cc82b9dcdf92133404:7;\" style=\"width:83.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液与过量<img src=\"chem-asset:84aa914b15eaaa9f0ada923f407449d807594014225471776a48f7acb53abc9d:8;\" style=\"width:67.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">溶液反应：<img src=\"chem-asset:26b922c918056b8630a2c05e108660481d0675b1d7aa1cc374068401b317e30a:9;\" style=\"width:253.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】D</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【详解】A．次氯酸根具有氧化性，会将SO<sub>2</sub>氧化为<img src=\"chem-asset:de3c489d318af55ff63ce996b6f63a911b4ff5c6092f42796b4019694667b83e:10;\" style=\"width:36.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，生成CaSO<sub>4</sub>沉淀，该反应的离子方程式为：Ca<sup>2+</sup> + 3ClO<sup>-</sup> +H<sub>2</sub>O+ SO<sub>2</sub> =CaSO<sub>4</sub>↓ + Cl<sup>-</sup> +2HClO，故A错误；</p><p>B．向氨水中滴加少量CuSO<sub>4</sub>时，氨水过量，Cu<sup>2+</sup>会与NH<sub>3</sub>形成[Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>]<sup>2+</sup>络合物，反应的离子方程式为Cu<sup>2+</sup>+4<img src=\"chem-asset:9c603a3b9f7257d90feb0ade8ece7f874fa45c5638281331b5114ab6550afe50:11;\" style=\"width:67.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">=[Cu(NH<sub>3</sub>)<sub>4</sub>]<sup>2+</sup>+4H<sub>2</sub>O，故B错误；</p><p>C．溴乙酸（BrCH<sub>2</sub>COOH）在足量NaOH溶液并加热条件下，溴原子会发生水解反应，被羟基取代生成羟基乙酸钠HOCH<sub>2</sub>COO<sup>-</sup>，反应的离子方程式为：BrCH<sub>2</sub>COOH + 2OH<sup>-</sup> → HOCH<sub>2</sub>COO<sup>-</sup> + Br<sup>-</sup> + H<sub>2</sub>O，故C错误；</p><p>D．碳酸氢钙[Ca(HCO<sub>3</sub>)<sub>2</sub>]与过量氢氧化钙[Ca(OH)<sub>2</sub>]反应时，碳酸钙沉淀和水，反应的离子方程式为Ca<sup>2+</sup> + <img src=\"chem-asset:36acd1a0716c38cd0c31eb4ed7a9350c515f55a10ad4988a9b4e2f2f8b0210cc:12;\" style=\"width:45.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"> + OH<sup>-</sup> = CaCO<sub>3</sub>↓ + H<sub>2</sub>O ，故 D正确；</p><p>选D。</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三上学期模拟预测化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三上学期模拟预测化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%EF%BC%88%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E7%89%88%EF%BC%89.docx\">打开原来源文件</a></details></main></body></html>","assets":["0f0983ff0c1f496c39a6f22a5af50a53d1db835ba30cb8fe5dabce67223ac539","26b922c918056b8630a2c05e108660481d0675b1d7aa1cc374068401b317e30a","36acd1a0716c38cd0c31eb4ed7a9350c515f55a10ad4988a9b4e2f2f8b0210cc","5ec490b9a93fd999f26001f80983ab9d1b545c7ee40aa2cc82b9dcdf92133404","84aa914b15eaaa9f0ada923f407449d807594014225471776a48f7acb53abc9d","8e8545a924bef272a7a6501251db651524b8ac36271a65e524b79ac375dd4622","925ca357b4a59303ab68dd83197b7e8c670a858828c4f00a4f510884ca202a9b","9c603a3b9f7257d90feb0ade8ece7f874fa45c5638281331b5114ab6550afe50","a282ffd93022e2d9ae45ebc75672299a413c6e67023cd6ee91610e3f288054ff","b460a2d7e3f0ea70af13a087a22216cbfce3956330d224f034b7c9946302625b","bf1aed82ef10df2ffe2db3a34ae024b72d56badb0b98b5039cef3271926dd9bd","de3c489d318af55ff63ce996b6f63a911b4ff5c6092f42796b4019694667b83e","ea7f7fc3eae810109f9ff922293bfc5a1bf5f2b660eaa08c22592fd85c2e085d"],"sourceSha256":"3c7af09aaeb254c92fffaf59e842e3e40f26b14031c96377020fa5d87937be12"},"2026.3.9:P11-Q14":{"html":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>铜配离子与三元酸的分布曲线</title><!--chem-style:3f988976c5a5937e0558eab589702caac8cb68489be57106907d457df806601d--></head><body><main><a class=\"back\" href=\"../../../../%E9%98%85%E8%AF%BB%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3.html\">← 返回题库</a><div class=\"eyebrow\">2026.3.9 · 雅礼2026届高三上模拟预测 · 原题14 · P11-Q14</div><h1>铜配离子与三元酸的分布曲线</h1><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag main-tag\">主类别：物质结构与性质/分子结构与性质/配合物</span></div><p class=\"rationale\">分类依据：读取分布系数求配位电离常数和酸度。</p><details><summary>相关知识点</summary><div class=\"tags\"><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/弱电解质的电离/电离平衡常数和电离度</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/水的电离及溶液的酸碱性/溶液的酸碱性与pH</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡常数</span><span class=\"tag\">化学反应原理/化学平衡/化学平衡图像</span></div></details><div class=\"card original\"><details><summary>展开原题题干与配图</summary><div><p>可能用到的相对原子质量：H∼1  N∼14  O∼16  Na∼23  S∼32  Cl∼35.5  Ti∼48</p><p>14. 已知<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:0;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:74936b287eb4b6819b4456024358c61e1c3c921daabd2abf8683135de0c353bc:1;\" style=\"width:24.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">结合形成两种配离子<img src=\"chem-asset:d67bf5941b97e3af5187e0207c06a26af011446e32a12191f8641e520c4ef237:2;\" style=\"width:49.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:a3a60ff953b77192f3c7c005039704e8312929eff902c7d827bf87d91f7e54c8:3;\" style=\"width:62.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">常温下，<img src=\"chem-asset:8ad3142d878851d093926c23ac2a1bd484387eb6013900a2a14a52a056177266:4;\" style=\"width:90.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:a2367d72d77048bde7c6254902108cba6cc8b9168f9d71eb5fd7262f540e8989:5;\" style=\"width:32.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:bfa3edc2950e41db4c8eddbbcccca88b76db73413f46939f5021208b22167911:6;\" style=\"width:86.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的<img src=\"chem-asset:bf1aed82ef10df2ffe2db3a34ae024b72d56badb0b98b5039cef3271926dd9bd:7;\" style=\"width:49.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">混合溶液中，<img src=\"chem-asset:f3aa23a44ca69561d91891b895c9b5f773fb557cad8829726b941d371a677cd4:8;\" style=\"width:36.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:74936b287eb4b6819b4456024358c61e1c3c921daabd2abf8683135de0c353bc:1;\" style=\"width:24.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的浓度对数<img src=\"chem-asset:ba59e833cde500dbdf29827e34d61c420f0545a58a2951f3b02d28c7fa93f04b:9;\" style=\"width:24.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(实线)、含铜微粒的分布系数<img src=\"chem-asset:e6b172dcc8e5d1b3d474c5dec6a88e90122dfc7665a4065414cd0bdbaae3207d:10;\" style=\"width:12.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">(虚线)[例如<img src=\"chem-asset:f4c736c4eacc427e55cefe539dd09c572cd8da41d9220576d1014150255bc444:11;\" style=\"width:281.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">]与溶液pH的关系如图所示：</p><p><img src=\"chem-asset:f7619ca2abf6ab58fa913bf70f37d3e336c0174ac120f1867104b4913ffc7ef3:12;\" style=\"width:364.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>下列说法错误的是</p><p>A. <img src=\"chem-asset:87c5e95e54d8f9e44621248f014e366b723071c40eaca41ea6002471cebcacdc:13;\" style=\"width:202.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>B. <img src=\"chem-asset:62972bdaf9e45fef5488bdc24c97ce95324fa138d5fcd3bb1fb40109cb9fddd4:14;\" style=\"width:190.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>C. 图中a点对应的<img src=\"chem-asset:b3c26fd1c57e21eb433eeba996ff14d6bfd933cfecbc3f6334555fa1d8598d0a:15;\" style=\"width:61.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>D. 当<img src=\"chem-asset:5fe7e5645c5ee00d15397292209ac41adace6ba2521223808b8f4dada29f43be:16;\" style=\"width:61.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">时，体系中<img src=\"chem-asset:ef2efe11b89e1e91ec21f957108389d7d8f1ef194c47d9c3a8ad40413f255ae6:17;\" style=\"width:293.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\"></p></div></details><h2>原答案</h2><div class=\"answers\"><p>【答案】C</p></div><h2>原解析</h2><div class=\"analysis\"><p>【解析】</p><p>【分析】<img src=\"chem-asset:f3aa23a44ca69561d91891b895c9b5f773fb557cad8829726b941d371a677cd4:8;\" style=\"width:36.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:74936b287eb4b6819b4456024358c61e1c3c921daabd2abf8683135de0c353bc:1;\" style=\"width:24.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">之间存在<img src=\"chem-asset:df8aae429cf69ab71082ccd5bee63ce39ebd1995df679b82a23cad1d2e8bc57c:18;\" style=\"width:116.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">转化关系，则pH较小时，平衡逆向移动，以<img src=\"chem-asset:f3aa23a44ca69561d91891b895c9b5f773fb557cad8829726b941d371a677cd4:8;\" style=\"width:36.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">为主，则<img src=\"chem-asset:f0306801cd7288d3c8f52b569f6e83b25ae51c12919f16b2d5c16cbe0f1b89d0:19;\" style=\"width:108.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:09cc18cda9901260f5c761386ca8c5da98c1c04977abecf8692f6589a8124755:20;\" style=\"width:140.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，则曲线I代表<img src=\"chem-asset:8ccfdd3c65082b656c09c6ea98ae83540ee343149dfd02707f6343264a486249:21;\" style=\"width:66.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，曲线II代表<img src=\"chem-asset:df6e13fe8b93b22460609d15a86120e30830696e608d81e8c1acb8895d7f5355:22;\" style=\"width:57.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，随着pH增大，<img src=\"chem-asset:df8aae429cf69ab71082ccd5bee63ce39ebd1995df679b82a23cad1d2e8bc57c:18;\" style=\"width:116.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">正向移动，<img src=\"chem-asset:9483e4907a43e938d31e5d0be591720dbba6623de5d5dd5e65f6eef248633490:23;\" style=\"width:42.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">增大，<img src=\"chem-asset:d50d784048dc4c6a2c0ca498ff5f7baeac5aaa79d2cc9be824f25c85934985ed:0;\" style=\"width:34.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">和<img src=\"chem-asset:74936b287eb4b6819b4456024358c61e1c3c921daabd2abf8683135de0c353bc:1;\" style=\"width:24.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">结合形成配离子的反应依次为<img src=\"chem-asset:b49bd1bf5aeef8c0a8455bee06ed2090f14d863b7c8eed7c5a21160cb91becd0:24;\" style=\"width:165.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">、<img src=\"chem-asset:ce0c2730d605b5768afd588bf5930ea6d745ad0a39ae333ca1e64ac91677ecb7:25;\" style=\"width:193.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，因此随pH增大，<img src=\"chem-asset:aba3018f92587c8f11125e4dce7b0dfdedea5b27b614abb4f4d9d4d30e79008c:26;\" style=\"width:33.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">持续减小，为曲线III，<img src=\"chem-asset:3c519d555c55e4412a481f9d80b1a96216bdd4c7b2a6a5940a2b2c9ab563e815:27;\" style=\"width:41.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，先增大后减小，为曲线IV，<img src=\"chem-asset:7aeb3b9d81cda9b5dc6c74583f1a1b41d685ebe6e9465556851525a1dc76af88:28;\" style=\"width:49.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">一直增大，为曲线V，据此回答。</p><p>【详解】A．曲线III和曲线IV的交点代表<img src=\"chem-asset:85c375caf6c447ff4fc632c2a7e2ef36825204a33c010c560a2a9def661d7d6e:29;\" style=\"width:86.53px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即<img src=\"chem-asset:b67285e04ba8e2661de5f809f2e27281cc4c8b6b28cab288ce3a2299d43971e6:30;\" style=\"width:130.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，由图可知，此时<img src=\"chem-asset:a93076113fd41df62b33da045f35edf8d2cac6bb7cceb58db00879a8aef303de:31;\" style=\"width:102.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，带入平衡表达式得<img src=\"chem-asset:7bc5cdb083a1cc8d9a85274fcfa35a270ce3715c20904763bd87820c3662f8bf:32;\" style=\"width:222.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，A正确；</p><p>B．曲线I和曲线II的交点代表<img src=\"chem-asset:2f9d750f04aab46bef7370fd005e497f846b2bbfe4dc35ef3d26e689e3a6cbf6:33;\" style=\"width:138.73px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即<img src=\"chem-asset:488208c57630757ae43c523c7cf27cb4e168ab5b60afa05686d20fdfbfb7b3fb:34;\" style=\"width:109.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，此时pH=11.6，带入平衡常数表达式得<img src=\"chem-asset:9b15082b8748a93bc036d0236acfbf11b94f2819a4638de3e1b93968ba07001d:35;\" style=\"width:170.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，B正确；</p><p>C．曲线IV和曲线V得交点代表，<img src=\"chem-asset:28c00457d5ab07f71ffe68501308c8e78d4781015c7c44086a1e25b0f53c06eb:36;\" style=\"width:101.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，即<img src=\"chem-asset:d768710770b471c3c7d7937924ebf5002a84ca162c8af03914b9e8b8ff12e343:37;\" style=\"width:162.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，此时<img src=\"chem-asset:0ffc8a6f1d9eaffa3ea9813825fb90f1b5086c4532d5192fbd414340c01b8180:38;\" style=\"width:102.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，可得<img src=\"chem-asset:320590e3b37e4ad0c90a540aaa136aef8ae91ccb85f8ebfd6d072192f3b33cac:39;\" style=\"width:168.27px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡常数<img src=\"chem-asset:1071258160cfac4c9384756a85d8dc9e928f548cc168fca17610918ef067b561:40;\" style=\"width:242.67px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，a点时，<img src=\"chem-asset:8b3984eb447d4e6f99d9990c650b65e4fcd54e0688776bfbc311f103b997e57c:41;\" style=\"width:94.40px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，带入<img src=\"chem-asset:1825be387938c5b298a792f42f110d45ff740f8b31eb717d19b4adf1b3b1abe7:42;\" style=\"width:484.00px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，解得<img src=\"chem-asset:d3b934a8a68fcc4ad1007965018ba31704504524b553828e79c5755bb59a3a80:43;\" style=\"width:130.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，且a点对应<img src=\"chem-asset:1d59f82e7d28ce1253aed819b9b3870e098cba71747a7ad65401c511d8919583:44;\" style=\"width:128.20px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，带入<img src=\"chem-asset:df8aae429cf69ab71082ccd5bee63ce39ebd1995df679b82a23cad1d2e8bc57c:18;\" style=\"width:116.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">的平衡常数<img src=\"chem-asset:9b15082b8748a93bc036d0236acfbf11b94f2819a4638de3e1b93968ba07001d:35;\" style=\"width:170.93px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，计算得<img src=\"chem-asset:750ac54d46d9732174598c19553ccfe69f35a164335ce9e9b2449e033fbac873:45;\" style=\"width:130.80px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，故pH=4.3，C错误；</p><p>D．当pH=6.4时，<img src=\"chem-asset:3c752ee72a7beb187f2ee55b0bfd6fffce58cd16a7fc98d9b7a0dfb36b6165a4:46;\" style=\"width:54.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">最大，接近<img src=\"chem-asset:faddf7c4b8a140337491b82864a11f97b7a0ff689bfddbe5ee094a15a9b0bf0f:47;\" style=\"width:69.07px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，结合B项中平衡常数可计算得<img src=\"chem-asset:47bbab67bd630e75449f33f30ef1fa5567a98d1b5249dc6607dfedd911b13384:48;\" style=\"width:131.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:58a8539f2c0de70b0730bcb49bc5164234a552f90d0e2e96134c0c6b0b519088:49;\" style=\"width:93.33px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:f8c6c2ded849bf6cfc0ac333a1725900c6f6cc999cc93d3dc94ebb1603356c00:50;\" style=\"width:85.47px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">结合Cu 元素守恒知，<img src=\"chem-asset:f07814948dc33bbd363f7642e28f34d4535a53a82f1e3cadce81b07f51e24a64:51;\" style=\"width:288.60px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，<img src=\"chem-asset:ada85ada8cca65269bbed0e9376e4782ff411d0f95271b0ad540f44405bc7b24:52;\" style=\"width:317.13px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，因此体系中<img src=\"chem-asset:cf58b7f6b84d55e7641940365f3a40f39edd266b6d1676836ead403852bc5ac0:53;\" style=\"width:289.87px;\" alt=\"原文图形或公式\" loading=\"lazy\">，D正确； </p><p>故选C。</p><p>第Ⅱ卷 非选择题(共58分)</p><p>二、非选择题(本题共4小题，共58分)</p></div></div><p class=\"note\">原答案和解析按原内容保留，未逐题独立重解或校订。知识点及小问标签为本次整理标注。</p><details><summary>来源与核对</summary><p>D:\\高中化学\\01_资料层\\高中试卷\\2026.3.9\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三上学期模拟预测化学试题\\精品解析：湖南长沙市雅礼中学2026届高三上学期模拟预测化学试题（解析版）.docx</p><a href=\"file:///D:/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6/01_%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E5%B1%82/%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%AD%E8%AF%95%E5%8D%B7/2026.3.9/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/%E7%B2%BE%E5%93%81%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%9A%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%97%E9%95%BF%E6%B2%99%E5%B8%82%E9%9B%85%E7%A4%BC%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A62026%E5%B1%8A%E9%AB%98%E4%B8%89%E4%B8%8A%E5%AD%A6%E6%9C%9F%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%